# MiniOneRec-CAT -- keep generated artefacts out of version control.
#
# The code, configs and docs under this directory are meant to be committed; the
# embedding copies, RQ-VAE checkpoints, regenerated SID catalogues and derived
# splits are large, reproducible, and experiment-local.

# generated artefacts
runs/
logs/

# never commit staged embedding copies or checkpoints, wherever they appear here
*.pth
*.npy
*.npz
*.safetensors
